*.doc binary
*.docx binary
*.xls binary
*.xlsx binary
*.ppt binary
*.pptx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mat binary
*.parquet binary
